## Database Backups (Turso LibSQL)

Turso automatically manages point-in-time database backups. For manual snapshot exports:

```bash
cd lament-scrapper
bun run backup
```

This exports SQL table dumps into local storage key snapshots.

---

## Object Storage Synchronization

To replicate or back up Cloudflare R2 media files to local storage, use AWS CLI S3 sync:

```bash
aws s3 sync s3://lament-media ./backup-media \
  --endpoint-url https://<account_id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
```
